    <div class="note mt-2">
      <strong>Sea planning default:</strong> Shanghai, Ningbo-Zhoushan and Shenzhen to Rotterdam are
      recorded at roughly 30 days on the current Cape routing, with the Red Sea reroute adding about
      +10–14 days over the old Suez routing. Rail is roughly 18–22 days into Europe before the final
      Rotterdam connection. Both are planning estimates, not carrier promises — for air, express or a
      specific door-to-door move, request a routing quote before committing to a date.
    </div>
